                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is ... well...I don't really think of it as a game.  Its more like a joke with 100 different possible punchlines.  Don't get me wrong, its worth what I paid for it.  For the record, I got it for 1.99 USD.  One play through takes maybe one or two minutes and is worth a chuckle or two.  Good if you only got a minute or so and just need a laugh. With different possible \"punchlines\" it can lift your spirits a few times.\n\nDon't buy if you want something serious or challenging though.  The story is pretty much A+(user choice)=X and literally is finished in about 1 or two minutes flat.  Replay multiple times to unlock multiple \"punchlines\".",
